      "en": "MECHANICAL METHODS OR APPARATUS IN THE MANUFACTURE OF ARTIFICIAL FILAMENTS, THREADS, FIBRES, BRISTLES OR RIBBONS<br><br><u>NOTE</u><br><br>Attention is drawn to the note following the title of Class D01.<br>Apparatus specially adapted for the manufacture of carbon filaments are classified in group D01F9/12<br><br><u>WARNING</u><br><br>In this subclass non-limiting references (in the sense of paragraph 39 of the Guide to the IPC) may still be displayed in the scheme.",
