      "code": "D21C11/06",
      "level": 8,
      "parent": "D21C11/00",
      "ja": "パルプ化の際に生じるガスの処理；ガス中の熱回収；｛紙パルプ工場の様々な供給源から発生するガスの処理；ガス状ＳＯ２の再生，例．硫黄化合物を含むパルプ廃液から発生するもの｝",
      "en": "Treatment of pulp gases; Recovery of the heat content of the gases; {Treatment of gases arising from various sources in pulp and paper mills; Regeneration of gaseous SO2, e.g. arising from liquors containing sulfur compounds}",
