      "level": 8,
      "parent": "D21H3/00",
      "ja": "｛装飾用紙に異なる色を付けるために不溶性の有色物質を加えるもの，例．紙に色をつける粉末，繊維，金属片；化学的構成よりも物理的外観，例．形状，に特徴のある物質｝",
      "en": "{by adding insoluble coloured substances, e.g. powders, fibres, pieces of metal, for obtaining different colours in the paper fancy papers; substances characterised by their physical appearance, e.g. form, rather than by their chemical constitution}",
